IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `eia-core`
IMPORT `ei6-part-8-5-fishers`

-- Tests of ei6-part-8-5-fishers (Act ss 153.1922 to 153.1925, src:3040-3056). Expected values are read from the text by hand.

§ `The periods of section 153.1923`

-- (a)(ii): September 29, 2019 to June 20, 2020 (src:3045).
#ASSERT `the day` (YearMonthDay 2019 9 29) `falls within` `s 153.1923(1)(a)(ii) the period in which the earlier benefit period must have been established`
#ASSERT `the day` (YearMonthDay 2020 6 20) `falls within` `s 153.1923(1)(a)(ii) the period in which the earlier benefit period must have been established`
#ASSERT NOT (`the day` (YearMonthDay 2019 9 28) `falls within` `s 153.1923(1)(a)(ii) the period in which the earlier benefit period must have been established`)
#ASSERT NOT (`the day` (YearMonthDay 2020 6 21) `falls within` `s 153.1923(1)(a)(ii) the period in which the earlier benefit period must have been established`)
-- (a)(iii): September 30, 2018 to June 15, 2019 (src:3046).
#ASSERT `the day` (YearMonthDay 2018 9 30) `falls within` `s 153.1923(1)(a)(iii) the period in which the earlier benefit period must have been established`
#ASSERT `the day` (YearMonthDay 2019 6 15) `falls within` `s 153.1923(1)(a)(iii) the period in which the earlier benefit period must have been established`
#ASSERT NOT (`the day` (YearMonthDay 2018 9 29) `falls within` `s 153.1923(1)(a)(iii) the period in which the earlier benefit period must have been established`)
#ASSERT NOT (`the day` (YearMonthDay 2019 6 16) `falls within` `s 153.1923(1)(a)(iii) the period in which the earlier benefit period must have been established`)
-- (b)(ii): March 29, 2020 to December 19, 2020 (src:3049).
#ASSERT `the day` (YearMonthDay 2020 3 29) `falls within` `s 153.1923(1)(b)(ii) the period in which the earlier benefit period must have been established`
#ASSERT `the day` (YearMonthDay 2020 12 19) `falls within` `s 153.1923(1)(b)(ii) the period in which the earlier benefit period must have been established`
#ASSERT NOT (`the day` (YearMonthDay 2020 3 28) `falls within` `s 153.1923(1)(b)(ii) the period in which the earlier benefit period must have been established`)
#ASSERT NOT (`the day` (YearMonthDay 2020 12 20) `falls within` `s 153.1923(1)(b)(ii) the period in which the earlier benefit period must have been established`)
-- (b)(iii): March 31, 2019 to December 21, 2019 (src:3050).
#ASSERT `the day` (YearMonthDay 2019 3 31) `falls within` `s 153.1923(1)(b)(iii) the period in which the earlier benefit period must have been established`
#ASSERT `the day` (YearMonthDay 2019 12 21) `falls within` `s 153.1923(1)(b)(iii) the period in which the earlier benefit period must have been established`
#ASSERT NOT (`the day` (YearMonthDay 2019 3 30) `falls within` `s 153.1923(1)(b)(iii) the period in which the earlier benefit period must have been established`)
#ASSERT NOT (`the day` (YearMonthDay 2019 12 22) `falls within` `s 153.1923(1)(b)(iii) the period in which the earlier benefit period must have been established`)
#ASSERT `s 153.1923(1)(b) the first day on which an initial claim may be made` EQUALS YearMonthDay 2021 3 28

§ `Section 153.1922 - eligibility`

-- The four periods together run from September 30, 2018 to December 19, 2020.
#ASSERT `s 153.1922 the day falls within one of the periods referred to in subparagraph 153.1923(1)(a)(ii) or (iii) or (b)(ii) or (iii)` (YearMonthDay 2018 9 30)
#ASSERT `s 153.1922 the day falls within one of the periods referred to in subparagraph 153.1923(1)(a)(ii) or (iii) or (b)(ii) or (iii)` (YearMonthDay 2020 12 19)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 153.1922 the day falls within one of the periods referred to in subparagraph 153.1923(1)(a)(ii) or (iii) or (b)(ii) or (iii)` (YearMonthDay 2018 9 29))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 153.1922 the day falls within one of the periods referred to in subparagraph 153.1923(1)(a)(ii) or (iii) or (b)(ii) or (iii)` (YearMonthDay 2020 12 20))
-- A fisher who does not meet the conditions of 8(2)(b) or (7)(b) and received section 8.1 benefits in one of the periods.
#ASSERT `s 153.1922 the fisher may receive benefits under section 8.1 of the Fishing Regulations by virtue of this section` TRUE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2020 1 10)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 153.1922 the fisher may receive benefits under section 8.1 of the Fishing Regulations by virtue of this section` TRUE TRUE (YearMonthDay 2020 1 10))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 153.1922 the fisher may receive benefits under section 8.1 of the Fishing Regulations by virtue of this section` TRUE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2021 1 10))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 153.1922 the fisher may receive benefits under section 8.1 of the Fishing Regulations by virtue of this section` FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2020 1 10))

§ `Section 153.1923 - determined earnings`

-- An earlier benefit period counts only if it was established within the period (src:3045-3046, 3049-3050).
#ASSERT `s 153.1923(1) the earnings of the earlier benefit period if it was established within the period` (JUST (`ei6 Earlier benefit period of a fisher` OF (YearMonthDay 2020 1 10), 30000)) `s 153.1923(1)(a)(ii) the period in which the earlier benefit period must have been established` EQUALS JUST 30000
#ASSERT `s 153.1923(1) the earnings of the earlier benefit period if it was established within the period` (JUST (`ei6 Earlier benefit period of a fisher` OF (YearMonthDay 2020 6 21), 30000)) `s 153.1923(1)(a)(ii) the period in which the earlier benefit period must have been established` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 153.1923(1) the earnings of the earlier benefit period if it was established within the period` NOTHING `s 153.1923(1)(a)(ii) the period in which the earlier benefit period must have been established` EQUALS NOTHING
-- The highest of the earnings that exist.
#ASSERT `s 153.1923(1) the highest of the earnings that exist` NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 153.1923(1) the highest of the earnings that exist` (JUST 100) NOTHING (JUST 300) EQUALS JUST 300
#ASSERT `s 153.1923(1) the highest of the earnings that exist` (JUST 500) (JUST 300) (JUST 400) EQUALS JUST 500
-- (a): arguments: not ceased; the earnings that would be used; the earlier benefit period of (ii); that of (iii).
#ASSERT `s 153.1923(1)(a) the earnings on which the rate of weekly benefits is calculated, for an initial claim under subsection 8(1)` TRUE (JUST 20000) (JUST (`ei6 Earlier benefit period of a fisher` OF (YearMonthDay 2020 1 10), 30000)) (JUST (`ei6 Earlier benefit period of a fisher` OF (YearMonthDay 2019 1 10), 25000)) EQUALS JUST 30000
-- the benefit period of (ii) was established after June 20, 2020: it does not count, so 25000 is the highest.
#ASSERT `s 153.1923(1)(a) the earnings on which the rate of weekly benefits is calculated, for an initial claim under subsection 8(1)` TRUE (JUST 20000) (JUST (`ei6 Earlier benefit period of a fisher` OF (YearMonthDay 2020 6 21), 30000)) (JUST (`ei6 Earlier benefit period of a fisher` OF (YearMonthDay 2019 1 10), 25000)) EQUALS JUST 25000
#ASSERT `s 153.1923(1)(a) the earnings on which the rate of weekly benefits is calculated, for an initial claim under subsection 8(1)` TRUE NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 153.1923(1)(a) the earnings on which the rate of weekly benefits is calculated, for an initial claim under subsection 8(1)` FALSE (JUST 20000) NOTHING NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
-- (b): an initial claim made on or after March 28, 2021 (src:3047).
#ASSERT `s 153.1923(1)(b) the earnings on which the rate of weekly benefits is calculated, for an initial claim under subsection 8(6)` TRUE (YearMonthDay 2021 3 28) (JUST 20000) (JUST (`ei6 Earlier benefit period of a fisher` OF (YearMonthDay 2020 12 19), 40000)) NOTHING EQUALS JUST 40000
#ASSERT `s 153.1923(1)(b) the earnings on which the rate of weekly benefits is calculated, for an initial claim under subsection 8(6)` TRUE (YearMonthDay 2021 3 27) (JUST 20000) (JUST (`ei6 Earlier benefit period of a fisher` OF (YearMonthDay 2020 12 19), 40000)) NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
-- the benefit period of (iii) was established on March 30, 2019, one day before the period begins: it does not count.
#ASSERT `s 153.1923(1)(b) the earnings on which the rate of weekly benefits is calculated, for an initial claim under subsection 8(6)` TRUE (YearMonthDay 2021 4 1) (JUST 20000) NOTHING (JUST (`ei6 Earlier benefit period of a fisher` OF (YearMonthDay 2019 3 30), 90000)) EQUALS JUST 20000
-- (2): once under paragraph (1)(a) and once under (1)(b) (src:3052).
#ASSERT `s 153.1923(2) a benefit period may be established for the fisher under paragraph (1)(a)` 0
#ASSERT NOT (`s 153.1923(2) a benefit period may be established for the fisher under paragraph (1)(a)` 1)
#ASSERT `s 153.1923(2) a benefit period may be established for the fisher under paragraph (1)(b)` 0
#ASSERT NOT (`s 153.1923(2) a benefit period may be established for the fisher under paragraph (1)(b)` 1)

§ `Sections 153.1924 and 153.1925`

#ASSERT `s 153.1924 the insurable earnings for the qualifying period` TRUE (JUST 30000) EQUALS JUST 30000
#ASSERT `s 153.1924 the insurable earnings for the qualifying period` TRUE NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 153.1924 the insurable earnings for the qualifying period` FALSE (JUST 30000) EQUALS NOTHING
-- 153.1925: at least $2,500 of insurable earnings from employment as a fisher (src:3056).
#ASSERT `s 153.1925 the insured person qualifies to receive the special benefits by this section` TRUE TRUE TRUE 2500
#ASSERT NOT (`s 153.1925 the insured person qualifies to receive the special benefits by this section` TRUE TRUE TRUE 2499.99)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 153.1925 the insured person qualifies to receive the special benefits by this section` TRUE FALSE TRUE 5000)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 153.1925 the insured person qualifies to receive the special benefits by this section` TRUE TRUE FALSE 5000)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 153.1925 the insured person qualifies to receive the special benefits by this section` FALSE TRUE TRUE 5000)
